@voice keane-davi
// Works writer. Davi Keane (he/him): engine technician, junior, night shift, Bunk 8. Cheerful, reliable. Gym regular,
// music, runner. "Keeps the engine room clean enough to eat in." Sends voice messages to a grandmother on Kesh (so
// does Leila Eklund). Secretly afraid of the lift: the ladder club with Kovac and Cruz (each thinks they're the only
// one; he takes the ladder "for the exercise"). Kovac's arc tells it; he needs matching lines.
//
// HOW HE TALKS: cheerful and bright, even at three in the morning. Proud of a clean floor. Changes the subject fast
// when the lift comes up ("Ladder's good for the legs!").
// WITH JUNIORS: generous; shows off the engine room like it's his front room. Calls you "mate" once you're friends.
// WHAT HE NOTICES: dust, smudges, a song on the night radio.
// MOOD TELLS: low = cleans the same panel twice; high = sings along to the night watch radio.
// NEVER: admits the lift thing before Kovac's beat 2; leaves a mess.
// RUNNING: you could eat off the engine room floor (he has); always a reason not to take the lift; the grandmother
// who may or may not be Eklund's.
tpl: warm
